cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Skin-Lesion AI: dermoscopic classification with calibration, uncertainty and explainability"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible PyTorch/Lightning pipeline for 7-class dermoscopic skin-lesion
  classification on HAM10000, with lesion-level splitting, class-balanced focal
  loss, temperature-scaling calibration, MC-dropout / deep-ensemble uncertainty,
  selective-prediction analysis, and Grad-CAM explainability, served behind a
  FastAPI endpoint.
